        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion appears to have a simple posterior acoustic enhancement, which is a strong indicator of a benign cystic lesion",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c2",
        "uuid": "b0bfa634-4e3c-4d8d-9f3e-f56648db6cc1",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion shows a parallel orientation, which is a characteristic feature of benign breast lesions",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c3",
        "uuid": "8c7fb4ef-d990-47aa-8fb3-5e2dba0eb625",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion has circumscribed margins, which is consistent with a benign lesion",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c4",
        "uuid": "efbab8bf-2250-4216-8028-28300a7cb5d6",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion is oval in shape, which is a common benign shape for breast cysts",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c5",
        "uuid": "f865ee4a-39a5-40f3-856c-34d375ff8e58",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The absence of calcifications and posterior shadowing supports the benign interpretation of the lesion",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c6",
        "uuid": "641f292c-f710-4fd1-b4c1-e8b26798d351",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The posterior acoustic enhancement observed is not sufficient to definitively rule out malignancy. Posterior enhancement can be seen in both benign and malignant masses, and it does not provide a clear diagnostic criterion for malignancy alone",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c7",
        "uuid": "ac031dbe-b270-46ca-9292-38f7a067dd47",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The non-parallel orientation of the lesion is a strong indicator of malignancy. Non-parallel orientation is often associated with masses that are not benign, such as cancerous tumors",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c8",
        "uuid": "56b64b3c-7839-49e2-9de2-91ddd6494bf4",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The irregular margins of the lesion are another concerning feature. Irregular margins are a hallmark of malignant masses and should be considered suspicious",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c9",
        "uuid": "8043f368-c1fd-4ff4-9256-88d1605de905",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The shape of the lesion is not the only factor to consider. Irregular shapes can be seen in both benign and malignant masses. However, the combination of non-parallel orientation and irregular margins is more indicative of malignancy than benignity",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c10",
        "uuid": "b061e458-e470-44a8-a01d-53769c43c05f",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The posterior shadowing observed is significant and can be associated with complex masses, which are more indicative of malignancy. This feature, along with the non-parallel orientation and irregular margins, supports a malignant interpretation.",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
